{"kind":"article","sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Automate model exploration and parameter optimization with ","type":"text"},{"code":"GridSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"RandomizedSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and the intelligent ","type":"text"},{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" model selector.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds","doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection"],"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials","generated":true,"title":"Guides & Tutorials"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Finding the optimal combination of hyperparameters is critical for maximizing generalization accuracy. ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftOptimize","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" provides exhaustive grid search, randomized sampling for high-dimensional parameter spaces, and end-to-end ","type":"text"},{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" selection across multiple model families.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"1. AutoML — Automated Model Selection","level":2,"anchor":"1-AutoML-Automated-Model-Selection","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"AutoML","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" cross-validates a fixed set of baseline architectures (Logistic\/Linear Regression, Decision Tree, Random Forest, MLP) and ranks them by the ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"mean per-fold","type":"text"}]},{"text":" score: macro F1 for classification, R² for regression. Classification uses ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":"; regression uses shuffled ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/KFold","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". All metrics come from ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import Foundation","import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ 1. Synthetic classification dataset","let N = 120","let D = 4","let X = (0..<N).map { i in","    (0..<D).map { d in Double(i * D + d) * 0.05 + sin(Double(i + d)) }","}","let y = (0..<N).map { i in Double(i % 2) }","","\/\/ 2. Configure AutoML with 3-fold stratified cross-validation","let autoML = AutoML(","    timeBudgetSeconds: 30,","    taskType: .classification,","    nFolds: 3,","    seed: 42",")","","\/\/ 3. Run model selection","let report = try await autoML.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","print(\"Best model: \\(await autoML.bestModelName ?? \"-\")\")","print(\"CV macro F1: \\(report.metrics[\"cv_score\"]!) ± \\(report.metrics[\"cv_std\"]!)\")","","for entry in await autoML.leaderboard {","    print(entry.displayName, entry.meanScore, entry.foldScores)","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Task type:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".auto"},{"type":"text","text":" (default) classifies integer targets with ≤ 10 distinct values, treats non-integer or high-cardinality targets as regression, and throws "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/AutoMLError\/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in between. Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"taskType"},{"type":"text","text":" explicitly in that case."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Time budget:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" soft. It is checked before each candidate and fold; a running fit is not interrupted, and the first candidate always completes."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Search:"}]},{"type":"text","text":" only "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".modelSelection"},{"type":"text","text":" is available. To tune hyperparameters of a single estimator, use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" below."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"2. Exhaustive Grid Search (`GridSearchCV`)","level":2,"anchor":"2-Exhaustive-Grid-Search-GridSearchCV","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"GridSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" exhaustively tests all Cartesian combinations of hyperparameter discrete values."}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","\/\/ Define hyperparameter search grid for DecisionTreeClassifier","let paramGrid: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"maxDepth\": [3, 5, 8],","    \"minSamplesSplit\": [2, 5, 10],","    \"criterion\": [\"gini\", \"entropy\"]","]","","let gridSearch = GridSearchCV(","    estimator: DecisionTreeClassifier(maxDepth: 3),","    paramGrid: paramGrid,","    cv: 5,","    scoring: .accuracy",")","","try await gridSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","","if let bestParams = gridSearch.bestParams {","    print(\"Optimal Depth: \\(bestParams[\"maxDepth\"] ?? \"default\")\")","    print(\"Peak CV Accuracy: \\(String(format: \"%.4f\", gridSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0))\")","}"]},{"type":"thematicBreak"},{"text":"3. Randomized Search (`RandomizedSearchCV`)","level":2,"anchor":"3-Randomized-Search-RandomizedSearchCV","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"When searching through large continuous or discrete combinatorial spaces, ","type":"text"},{"code":"RandomizedSearchCV","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" samples $N$ random configurations, finding near-optimal solutions in a fraction of the compute time.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import SwiftOptimize","import SwiftML","","let distributions: [String: [Any]] = [","    \"learningRate\": [0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.1],","    \"epochs\": [100, 200, 500, 1000],","    \"l2Penalty\": [0.0, 0.0001, 0.001, 0.01]","]","","let randomSearch = RandomizedSearchCV(","    estimator: LogisticRegression(learningRate: 0.01),","    paramDistributions: distributions,","    nIter: 20,","    cv: 3,","    randomSeed: 42",")","","try await randomSearch.fit(features: X, targets: y)","print(\"Top Configuration Score: \\(randomSearch.bestScore ?? 0.0)\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/HyperparameterTuning","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/hyperparametertuning"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize"]]},"metadata":{"title":"Hyperparameter Tuning & AutoML Engine","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiftOptimize"}]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize":{"type":"topic","title":"SwiftOptimize","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"AutoML, Cross-Validation Folds & Hyperparameter Tuning."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"collection"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/StratifiedKFold":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/StratifiedKFold","title":"StratifiedKFold","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stratified K-Fold cross-validator."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides train\/validation indices such that class proportions are preserved in each fold."}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"StratifiedKFold","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/stratifiedkfold","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/RandomizedSearchCV":{"type":"topic","title":"RandomizedSearchCV","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/RandomizedSearchCV","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Performs parallel Randomized Search over random hyperparameter combinations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"via K-Fold Cross-Validation."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSearchCV"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/randomizedsearchcv","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RandomizedSearchCV"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/GridSearchCV":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"GridSearchCV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/GridSearchCV","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Performs parallel Grid Search over a hyperparameter grid for DecisionTreeClassifier"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"to find the best hyperparameter combination via Stratified K-Fold Cross-Validation."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"GridSearchCV","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/gridsearchcv","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"GridSearchCV","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/ParallelModelSelection":{"title":"Concurrent Model Selection & Cross-Validation","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/parallelmodelselection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Harness all available Apple Silicon CPU and GPU cores using structured Swift Concurrency "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TaskGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" primitives."}],"kind":"article","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/ParallelModelSelection"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/CrossValidationFolds":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Evaluate model stability and generalization performance across dataset splits using "},{"code":"KFold","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"StratifiedKFold","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"TimeSeriesSplit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"title":"Cross-Validation Strategies","type":"topic","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/crossvalidationfolds","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/CrossValidationFolds"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/KFold":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"KFold","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/kfold","abstract":[{"text":"Splits a dataset into K folds for cross-validation.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/KFold","role":"symbol","title":"KFold","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KFold","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/EvaluationHarness":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"EvaluationHarness"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Unified Classifier & Regressor Evaluation Metrics Harness (G-019)."}],"title":"EvaluationHarness","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"EvaluationHarness"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/evaluationharness","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/EvaluationHarness"},"doc://SwiftOptimize/documentation/SwiftOptimize/AutoMLError/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".auto"},{"type":"text","text":" could not confidently decide between classification and regression."}],"title":"AutoMLError.ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ambiguousTaskType","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"uniqueValues","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"sampleCount","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swiftoptimize\/automlerror\/ambiguoustasktype(uniquevalues:samplecount:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftOptimize\/documentation\/SwiftOptimize\/AutoMLError\/ambiguousTaskType(uniqueValues:sampleCount:)"}}}